        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Brian O'Nolan, Myles na gCopaleen\n- Works: Ist das Ihr Fahrrad, Mr. O'Brien?, An Béal Bocht\n- Topics: Irish literature, radio plays, pseudonyms\n\nFacts:\n- Brian O'Nolan was born on 5 October 1911 and died on 1 April 1966.\n- Brian O'Nolan was an Irish novelist, playwright, and satirist who is considered a major figure in twentieth-century Irish literature.\n- Brian O'Nolan wrote many satirical columns in The Irish Times under the name Myles na gCopaleen.\n- Brian O'Nolan also wrote the Irish-language novel An Béal Bocht under the name Myles na gCopaleen.\n- Ist das Ihr Fahrrad, Mr. O'Brien? is a German biographical radio play about the life, works, and legacy of Brian O'Nolan.",
